### PetClinic · Gateway (composición, errores y documentación)
@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Composición: owner + mascotas + visitas de cada mascota
GET {{gateway}}/api/owners/6/details

### 2. Owner inexistente: 404 con ProblemDetail
GET {{gateway}}/api/owners/999/details

### 3. Error intencionado (portado de /oups, BR-SYS-01) → 500
GET {{gateway}}/api/system/boom

### 4. Swagger UI con las cuatro especificaciones (customers, vets, visits, gateway)
GET {{gateway}}/swagger-ui.html

### 5. OpenAPI del propio gateway
GET {{gateway}}/v3/api-docs

### 6. Salud de los servicios
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/health

### 7. Flujo E2E: crear owner → mascota → visita → composición
POST {{gateway}}/api/customers/owners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace",
  "address": "12 Analytical St.",
  "city": "London",
  "telephone": "6000000001"
}

### (usa el id devuelto arriba)

POST {{gateway}}/api/customers/owners/11/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada's cat",
  "birthDate": "2020-02-02",
  "typeId": 1
}

###

POST {{gateway}}/api/visits/owners/11/pets/14/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2027-01-15",
  "description": "first visit"
}

###

GET {{gateway}}/api/owners/11/details
